1
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:15,330
<i>Killing was what gave my life meaning.</i>

2
00:00:15,330 --> 00:00:18,040
<i>It's what made me feel truly alive.</i>

3
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:21,150
<i>I was standing atop this fight for survival.</i><i></i>

4
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:22,920
<i>Or so I thought.</i>

5
00:00:22,920 --> 00:00:24,620
<i>Until...</i>

6
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:34,170
<i>Now look at me.</i>

7
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:39,610
<i>The ghouls are wreaking havoc all over town.</i>

8
00:00:39,610 --> 00:00:42,360
<i>So I'll take anyone, 
even myself if I had to.</i><i></i>

9
00:00:42,650 --> 00:00:45,940
Just let me kill somebody!

10
00:00:49,830 --> 00:00:52,830
Stay out of my way, gruntlings!

11
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:55,870
Isn't he...

12
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:57,970
<i>That giant cleaver...</i>

13
00:00:57,970 --> 00:01:01,090
<i>A piercing glint in his eye, 
full of overwhelming savagery...</i><i></i>

14
00:01:01,090 --> 00:01:04,880
<i>He's the ruler of the Black Tower, 
Juggernaut the Tyrant!</i><i></i>

15
00:01:10,090 --> 00:01:13,820
<i>Those distinctive nine tails, 
a symbol of the highest ranking therianthropes...</i>

16
00:01:13,820 --> 00:01:16,880
<i>She's the ruler of the White Tower, 
Yukime the Spirit Fox!</i>

17
00:01:20,100 --> 00:01:24,430
I could never hope to defeat them, 
even if I give it my absolute all!

18
00:01:24,430 --> 00:01:27,420
Why did they have to come here 
onto my turf?!

19
00:01:33,420 --> 00:01:35,220
I am Shadow.

20
00:01:36,230 --> 00:01:38,210
He who lurks in the shadows

21
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:40,170
in order to hunt the shadows.

22
00:01:40,170 --> 00:01:41,920
Shadow?

23
00:01:42,180 --> 00:01:46,750
The Don of the armed militants who have taken 
the Midgar Royal Capital as their turf.

24
00:01:46,750 --> 00:01:52,000
Right, you're the boss of that gang 
that wiped the floor with those snooty priests.

25
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:55,180
Whatever, that's none of my business!

26
00:01:59,530 --> 00:02:01,360
Catch you later, she-fox.

27
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:03,110
Next time, I'll kill you.

28
00:02:03,110 --> 00:02:04,730
The moon is red.

29
00:02:05,560 --> 00:02:07,640
The frenzy has begun.

30
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:09,230
"Frenzy"?

31
00:02:09,230 --> 00:02:13,040
Are you referring to this 
current trouble with the ghouls?

32
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:18,650
You mean that Red Moon legend where they say 
three kingdoms fell when it was in the sky?

33
00:02:18,650 --> 00:02:19,930
Sounds good to me.

34
00:02:19,930 --> 00:02:23,120
In that case, those bats'll finally start 
to give me a decent workout.

35
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:24,820
That man...

36
00:02:25,330 --> 00:02:27,310
Well, I shall excuse myself.

37
00:02:27,310 --> 00:02:30,230
It seems you helped some of my girls 
in the pleasure district,

38
00:02:30,230 --> 00:02:32,220
so I hope we can remain on friendly terms,

39
00:02:32,220 --> 00:02:33,720
my dear Shadow.

40
00:02:35,010 --> 00:02:37,610
The entire castle gate is an artifact.

41
00:02:37,610 --> 00:02:40,430
How did he break it down 
with just a swing of his sword?!

42
00:02:40,940 --> 00:02:42,530
The Tyrant...

43
00:02:42,530 --> 00:02:45,030
and his rival, the Spirit Fox.

44
00:02:45,030 --> 00:02:47,330
They're both after the Blood Queen,

45
00:02:47,330 --> 00:02:50,140
and every single one of them 
is a good-for-nothing monster!

46
00:02:50,140 --> 00:02:51,520
You've gotta be kidding me.

47
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:54,120
I wanted to slice up some humans so badly...

48
00:02:56,230 --> 00:02:57,660
That guy...

49
00:02:58,020 --> 00:02:59,520
Who is he?

50
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:01,870
I don't sense any power from him at all.

51
00:03:03,020 --> 00:03:05,420
That means he's weaker than me.

52
00:03:10,230 --> 00:03:12,270
It's settled, then!

53
00:03:12,270 --> 00:03:14,150
You're my prey!

54
00:03:22,020 --> 00:03:23,420
<i>What in the...</i>

55
00:03:25,180 --> 00:03:26,960
<i>That guy...</i><i></i>

56
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,720
<i>Who the hell is he?!</i><i></i>

57
00:03:33,810 --> 00:03:35,290
The moon is red.

58
00:03:35,810 --> 00:03:37,510
The frenzy has begun.

59
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,370
We are out of time.

60
00:03:40,060 --> 00:03:42,540
Wh-What in the actual...

