949
00:05:14,990 --> 00:05:20,020
The Haven

950
00:05:16,400 --> 00:05:20,190
If this was 
the general technology of the time,

951
00:05:20,190 --> 00:05:23,670
then we can conclude the Cult 
was extraordinarily innovative.

952
00:05:24,020 --> 00:05:27,360
The source of their power 
was found in the Demon.

953
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:33,230
That makes sense, but where could they have possibly found 
the knowledge necessary to harness it?

954
00:05:42,040 --> 00:05:44,320
I told you not to touch things willy-nilly!

955
00:05:44,320 --> 00:05:46,370
I didn't think that would happen!

956
00:05:46,770 --> 00:05:50,580
Regardless, we've managed 
to successfully infiltrate the tower.

957
00:05:50,580 --> 00:05:54,690
I can't believe the passage turns into a slide 
and connects to this place.

958
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:58,670
What am I to do now?

959
00:05:59,050 --> 00:06:02,380
I'm supposed to eliminate all witnesses...

960
00:06:02,990 --> 00:06:04,880
but I don't think I can.

961
00:06:05,190 --> 00:06:08,480
I have no desire to fight you, Miss Claire.

962
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,350
You know me?

963
00:06:10,350 --> 00:06:14,810
You're Claire Kagenou, 
winner of the recent Bushin Festival, are you not?

964
00:06:16,230 --> 00:06:18,620
She does not seem to be a vampire

965
00:06:18,620 --> 00:06:22,150
and we do not have the time 
to fight unnecessary battles.

966
00:06:22,150 --> 00:06:23,030
Besides...

967
00:06:23,630 --> 00:06:24,820
she is not alone.

968
00:06:24,820 --> 00:06:28,370
So hey, why does Lady Beta 
keep hiding her face?

969
00:06:28,370 --> 00:06:30,110
You keep quiet!

970
00:06:30,110 --> 00:06:31,310
All right.

971
00:06:31,310 --> 00:06:34,830
Tell us who you are 
and what you're here for.

972
00:06:35,850 --> 00:06:38,480
I am Beta of Shadow Garden.

973
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,280
Shadow Garden?

974
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:42,710
The punks who burned down our school?

975
00:06:42,710 --> 00:06:45,360
So what, you're gonna do 
the same thing with the tower now?

976
00:06:47,090 --> 00:06:50,580
I was doing research on the possessed 
for reasons I can't go into.

977
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:54,440
And for that, I'm hoping for a blood sample 
from a Progenitor Vampire.

978
00:06:54,790 --> 00:06:57,770
What do Progenitor Vampires 
have to do with the possessed?

979
00:06:58,140 --> 00:07:02,270
When traced back to their origins, 
the possessed and vampires are the same.

980
00:07:02,270 --> 00:07:06,560
In the process of descendency, 
the bloodlines changed and split off from one another.

981
00:07:06,560 --> 00:07:09,810
That's the theory we developed 
in the process of our research.

982
00:07:09,810 --> 00:07:11,400
To test that hypothesis,

983
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:15,500
it has become necessary that we study the Blood Queen, 
as she is a Progenitor Vampire.

984
00:07:15,820 --> 00:07:18,270
The possessed and vampires are...

985
00:07:18,270 --> 00:07:20,720
That is blasphemy against the Progenitors!

986
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:23,060
And why would that make you angry,

987
00:07:23,060 --> 00:07:27,830
my dear thousand-year-old rumor, 
Miss Ancient Vampire Hunter?

988
00:07:27,830 --> 00:07:29,650
You know me, too?

989
00:07:29,650 --> 00:07:31,970
We will stay out of your way,

990
00:07:31,970 --> 00:07:34,630
and you will stay out of our way.

991
00:07:34,630 --> 00:07:36,920
Can we just leave it at that?

992
00:07:38,060 --> 00:07:39,520
Just tell me one thing.

993
00:07:39,980 --> 00:07:42,120
Is there a way to cure the possessed?

994
00:07:44,110 --> 00:07:47,330
You have absolutely nothing to worry about.

995
00:07:47,330 --> 00:07:48,720
What does that mean?

996
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,230
It's exactly as I said.

997
00:07:50,820 --> 00:07:53,180
Fine. Let's go, Mary.

998
00:07:53,180 --> 00:07:56,420
If we keep wasting time here, 
we'll never save my brother.

999
00:07:57,570 --> 00:07:58,990
Your brother?

1000
00:07:58,990 --> 00:08:01,150
The people here kidnapped him.

1001
00:08:01,150 --> 00:08:03,750
If we don't hurry, 
he'll be sacrificed to the Blood Queen.

1002
00:08:03,750 --> 00:08:05,460
Well, that'sâ

1003
00:08:04,180 --> 00:08:05,460
Is that true?

1004
00:08:05,460 --> 00:08:06,610
Is it true?! Is Ciâ

1005
00:08:06,610 --> 00:08:07,870
Number 666...

1006
00:08:08,460 --> 00:08:10,440
Stand down, that's an order.

1007
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:11,690
But...

1008
00:08:11,690 --> 00:08:13,580
I mean, apologies.

1009
00:08:13,580 --> 00:08:14,920
I assume we're done here.

1010
00:08:15,210 --> 00:08:17,480
Don't forget to keep 
your end of the bargain.

1011
00:08:20,940 --> 00:08:22,280
If I may ask...

1012
00:08:23,190 --> 00:08:25,830
Have you no desire to strive for 
the Haven once more?

1013
00:08:27,530 --> 00:08:28,630
Mary?

1014
00:08:30,630 --> 00:08:32,000
Hey, wait...

1015
00:08:35,830 --> 00:08:38,690
You disappoint me, Number 666.

1016
00:08:38,690 --> 00:08:40,040
My deepest apologies.

1017
00:08:40,270 --> 00:08:42,440
And you two are supposed 
to keep her in line.

1018
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,880
We're sorry!

1019
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:45,630
Really sorry!

1020
00:08:45,630 --> 00:08:49,690
Our mission is to obtain the sample, 
nothing more.

1021
00:08:49,690 --> 00:08:53,480
Lord Shadow will be the one to deal 
with the Blood Queen.

1022
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:57,270
That will eliminate all problems, 
including the issue with the sacrifice.

1023
00:08:57,880 --> 00:09:00,080
Do you understand, Number 666?

1024
00:09:00,590 --> 00:09:01,480
Yes.

1025
00:09:03,430 --> 00:09:06,120
<i>Babysitting is part of the job, Beta.</i>

1026
00:09:15,750 --> 00:09:17,120
Now, strike the heart!

1027
00:09:17,120 --> 00:09:17,980
I know!

1028
00:09:24,590 --> 00:09:28,080
Even an immortal vampire will die 
if its heart is destroyed.

1029
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:30,670
And they don't do well in the sun, you said?

1030
00:09:30,990 --> 00:09:33,630
You're a vampire hunter, all right. 
You really know your stuff.

1031
00:09:33,790 --> 00:09:35,400
Let's hurry on.

1032
00:09:38,410 --> 00:09:40,380
You're hiding something from me, aren't you?

1033
00:09:41,110 --> 00:09:43,570
You were acting strange 
back there in the library,

1034
00:09:43,570 --> 00:09:46,180
almost like you were taking 
the vampires' side.

1035
00:09:47,150 --> 00:09:48,790
What are you really after?

1036
00:09:48,790 --> 00:09:50,320
The Blood Queen.

1037
00:09:50,320 --> 00:09:53,480
To vanquish her, right?

1038
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:56,180
I have lived this long 
only to achieve my purpose.

1039
00:09:56,980 --> 00:09:59,610
Then what was that thing Beta mentioned?

1040
00:09:59,610 --> 00:10:01,580
What is the "Haven"?

1041
00:10:01,580 --> 00:10:04,400
You don't look like an elf, 
but you're a thousand yeâ

1042
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:05,040
Claire!

1043
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:07,280
You are not any different.

1044
00:10:07,280 --> 00:10:09,950
A possessed can never become human again.

1045
00:10:09,950 --> 00:10:12,010
That is obvious, everyone knows it.

1046
00:10:12,010 --> 00:10:14,970
Then why would you ask that stupid question?

1047
00:10:15,450 --> 00:10:17,370
Everyone has their secrets.

1048
00:10:17,370 --> 00:10:18,620
You know that.

1049
00:10:18,620 --> 00:10:22,080
I won't pry into yours, 
and you won't pry into mine.

1050
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,490
Can't that be good enoughâ

1051
00:10:24,430 --> 00:10:25,500
What happened?

1052
00:10:25,500 --> 00:10:27,090
This magical energy...

1053
00:10:35,040 --> 00:10:39,180
They say you have to crush 
a vampire's heart to kill it.

1054
00:10:39,180 --> 00:10:41,310
But you're still so weak.

1055
00:10:41,310 --> 00:10:43,980
Thought this guy was one of the top brass 
around here.

1056
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:45,000
Well, whatever.

1057
00:10:45,420 --> 00:10:47,520
There's plenty more where he came from.

1058
00:10:48,400 --> 00:10:50,470
Hey, losers.

1059
00:10:50,820 --> 00:10:53,970
Where can I find the Blood Queen?

1060
00:11:01,450 --> 00:11:02,740
That's...

1061
00:11:02,740 --> 00:11:03,720
You know him?

1062
00:11:05,910 --> 00:11:08,090
He's Juggernaut the Tyrant.

1063
00:11:08,090 --> 00:11:10,760
The boss of the Black Tower, right?

1064
00:11:10,760 --> 00:11:14,910
And he's beating the third most eminently powerful vampire 
of this tower with such ease.

1065
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:16,610
What about the other two on the floor?

1066
00:11:16,610 --> 00:11:19,610
On the left is number five, 
and on the right is a Lost Number.

1067
00:11:19,610 --> 00:11:22,000
Those titles make them sound tough.

1068
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:28,680
Through sheer overwhelming violence, Juggernaut rose to the top 
to become one of the most powerful in the Lawless City.

1069
00:11:28,680 --> 00:11:29,840
Let's wait until he has gone.

1070
00:11:29,840 --> 00:11:31,720
We should avoid a fight with him.

1071
00:11:31,900 --> 00:11:34,140
Agreed, we need to get out of here 
before he findsâ

1072
00:11:36,410 --> 00:11:38,870
I have good instincts, y'know.

1073
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:41,340
All right, bat-face.

1074
00:11:41,340 --> 00:11:43,050
Die, if you know what's good for you!

1075
00:11:44,140 --> 00:11:44,850
Here we go!

1076
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:51,390
Claire!

1077
00:11:51,390 --> 00:11:53,730
Don't get distracted now!

1078
00:11:57,250 --> 00:12:00,060
Thought you'd be better 
than all those gruntlings.

1079
00:12:00,060 --> 00:12:02,120
Guess my instincts are getting rusty.

1080
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:10,090
You're one tough lady!

1081
00:12:10,090 --> 00:12:13,010
Most people I fight are down 
after the first punch.

1082
00:12:13,010 --> 00:12:16,220
You're the second person who's ever managed 
to hit me in the face!

1083
00:12:16,220 --> 00:12:18,190
Well, isn't that an honor!

1084
00:12:19,430 --> 00:12:20,780
Mary, are you all right?

1085
00:12:22,300 --> 00:12:23,580
Oh, no...

1086
00:12:24,260 --> 00:12:27,080
Mary! Mary, stay with me!

1087
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:27,720
Mary!

1088
00:12:28,280 --> 00:12:30,090
It's okay, I know first aid!

1089
00:12:31,100 --> 00:12:32,680
I'm okay.

1090
00:12:33,020 --> 00:12:35,860
It's just been so long...

1091
00:12:35,860 --> 00:12:36,830
Mary?

1092
00:12:37,530 --> 00:12:39,330
Forgive me, Claire.

1093
00:12:39,730 --> 00:12:41,830
But let me suck your blood.

1094
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:51,520
Wh-Wh-What are you doing?!

1095
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:56,050
Mary...

1096
00:13:01,450 --> 00:13:03,000
Well, well...

1097
00:13:03,700 --> 00:13:05,970
That damned bat...

1098
00:13:08,610 --> 00:13:10,680
Finally, a real fight!

1099
00:13:10,930 --> 00:13:15,370
But I'm still stronger!

1100
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:22,420
It's been so long that the blood 
isn't assimilating!

1101
00:13:28,980 --> 00:13:31,920
<i>I'm sorry, Cid.</i>

1102
00:13:40,910 --> 00:13:44,260
What the hell are ya doing, Shadow?!

1103
00:13:48,830 --> 00:13:50,290
Shadow?

1104
00:13:51,370 --> 00:13:53,190
The frenzy has begun.

1105
00:13:53,870 --> 00:13:56,190
We have little time remaining.

1106
00:14:01,610 --> 00:14:03,820
<i>The hour of awakening is near.</i>

1107
00:14:04,460 --> 00:14:06,020
Shadow?

1108
00:14:06,020 --> 00:14:09,130
I've heard the Church 
has marked him as an enemy.

1109
00:14:09,130 --> 00:14:11,320
Did he come to help us?

1110
00:14:14,230 --> 00:14:17,910
I'm sorry, Claire, for taking your blood.

1111
00:14:18,490 --> 00:14:19,770
It's fine.

1112
00:14:19,770 --> 00:14:22,890
Well, actually no, 
but I'm more concerned about...

1113
00:14:22,890 --> 00:14:24,190
Mary...

1114
00:14:24,190 --> 00:14:26,190
Your secret is that you're...

1115
00:14:26,700 --> 00:14:29,890
Yes, I am a vampire.

1116
00:14:30,340 --> 00:14:32,260
I will tell you everything.

1117
00:14:32,260 --> 00:14:35,580
Who I am, why I'm here...

1118
00:14:35,580 --> 00:14:38,990
and the truth about the Blood Queen.

1119
00:14:43,370 --> 00:14:46,020
<i>More than a thousand years ago...</i>

1120
00:14:46,020 --> 00:14:48,820
<i>It was a golden age for vampires.</i>

1121
00:14:49,330 --> 00:14:52,930
<i>They would hunt the humans, 
devour them like animals,</i>

1122
00:14:52,930 --> 00:14:56,020
<i>and consume their blood, 
all as if it were a game.</i><i></i>

1123
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:58,520
<i>But times changed.</i>

1124
00:14:59,030 --> 00:15:04,690
<i>Humans learned the vampires' weaknesses, 
and the hunters became the hunted.</i><i></i>

1125
00:15:04,690 --> 00:15:08,840
<i>In the blink of an eye, 
they would vanish from the face of the Earth.</i>

1126
00:15:14,330 --> 00:15:17,520
<i>During that time, the Blood Queen, 
my Lady Elisabeth,</i>

1127
00:15:17,520 --> 00:15:21,830
<i>was living among humans 
as the ruler of a small fiefdom.</i>

1128
00:15:22,270 --> 00:15:26,810
<i>She wanted to live in harmony with the humans 
and voluntarily gave up blood.</i><i></i>

1129
00:15:27,750 --> 00:15:31,710
<i>As her subjects, we followed our queen's example 
and stopped drinking, as well.</i><i></i>

1130
00:15:32,240 --> 00:15:37,710
<i>As a result, we gradually lost our powers, 
but we gained other things in return.</i>

1131
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:41,450
<i>The ability to live 
in the light of the sun...</i>

1132
00:15:41,450 --> 00:15:44,100
<i>and tranquil hearts no different 
than those of humans.</i><i></i>

1133
00:15:44,590 --> 00:15:46,390
<i>Our thirst for blood waned,</i>

1134
00:15:46,390 --> 00:15:50,140
<i>and we were able to live 
in a beautiful world filled with light.</i>

1135
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:55,600
<i>But that was not so for Queen Elisabeth.</i>

1136
00:15:55,600 --> 00:15:57,800
<i>No matter how far 
she distanced herself from blood,</i>

1137
00:15:57,800 --> 00:16:00,760
<i>the maddening thirst for it never left her.</i>

1138
00:16:00,760 --> 00:16:03,730
<i>And when sunlight struck her, 
it would burn her skin hideously.</i>

1139
00:16:04,090 --> 00:16:05,810
<i>Nevertheless...</i>

1140
00:16:05,810 --> 00:16:08,020
Let us build a Haven here.

1141
00:16:08,370 --> 00:16:12,620
A land where humans and vampires 
can live together in happiness.

1142
00:16:13,020 --> 00:16:18,020
<i>The Haven she strove for 
did exist in that place.</i><i></i>

1143
00:16:18,520 --> 00:16:20,320
<i>I truly believed that.</i><i></i>

1144
00:16:21,500 --> 00:16:25,640
<i>But then came the night, once in a thousand years, 
when the Red Moon rose in the sky...</i>

1145
00:16:25,990 --> 00:16:29,090
<i>The night that gives vampires 
tremendous power.</i><i></i>

1146
00:16:29,620 --> 00:16:35,830
<i>Queen Elisabeth was starving for blood, 
and Crimson gave her a single drop.</i>

1147
00:16:44,730 --> 00:16:48,040
<i>Queen Elisabeth's frenzy 
lasted for three days and three nights.</i>

1148
00:16:49,020 --> 00:16:54,220
<i>The Haven disappeared into a pile of rubble, 
and three kingdoms suffered catastrophic damage.</i>

1149
00:16:54,750 --> 00:17:00,710
<i>I survived by lapping up the blood of the dead, 
and went in pursuit of my queen.</i>

1150
00:17:01,090 --> 00:17:06,030
<i>By the time I was reunited with her, 
it was all over.</i>

1151
00:17:06,030 --> 00:17:09,220
<i>This mistake must never be repeated.</i>

1152
00:17:09,870 --> 00:17:15,180
<i>Scatter my ashes into the ocean, 
so that my flesh can never revive.</i>

1153
00:17:16,280 --> 00:17:20,140
<i>Queen Elisabeth took a dagger 
and stabbed herself in the heart.</i>

1154
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:24,700
<i>If she had been an ordinary vampire, 
she would have disintegrated instantly,</i>

1155
00:17:24,700 --> 00:17:28,590
<i>but the queen never turned to ash.</i>

1156
00:17:29,250 --> 00:17:33,990
<i>There she was, her breath stopped, 
her heart stilled.</i>

1157
00:17:33,990 --> 00:17:37,800
<i>I could neither defy her wishes 
nor carry them out.</i>

1158
00:17:38,410 --> 00:17:43,790
<i>All I could do was vow to watch over her 
in her eternal slumber.</i>

1159
00:17:47,030 --> 00:17:49,640
<i>But that was a foolish choice.</i><i></i>

1160
00:17:49,640 --> 00:17:54,190
<i>Because immediately after, Crimson and his followers 
took Lady Elisabeth from me.</i><i></i>

1161
00:17:54,790 --> 00:17:58,590
Out of respect for your service 
in protecting Her Majesty, I will spare your life.

1162
00:17:58,590 --> 00:18:04,130
I pray that you will have chosen to join us by the next night, a thousand years hence.

1163
00:18:04,130 --> 00:18:09,600
<i>And now, indeed, he is attempting 
to use her again for his own ambition.</i>

1164
00:18:10,270 --> 00:18:13,790
<i>How can I possibly earn 
my queen's forgiveness?</i><i></i>

1165
00:18:15,620 --> 00:18:17,250
I'm no better than you.

1166
00:18:17,560 --> 00:18:19,650
I might be possessed.

1167
00:18:20,830 --> 00:18:24,030
I showed signs when I was a little girl.

1168
00:18:24,030 --> 00:18:26,190
One day, I will become a monster.

1169
00:18:26,800 --> 00:18:30,950
I hoped I could help my brother 
achieve something before that happened.

1170
00:18:30,950 --> 00:18:32,570
That's why I brought him here.

1171
00:18:32,890 --> 00:18:34,690
And now it's my fault he's...

1172
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:38,490
If anything happens to him, 
how can I ever apologize?

1173
00:18:39,120 --> 00:18:40,290
Claire...

1174
00:18:42,100 --> 00:18:45,190
So, your Haven...

1175
00:18:45,710 --> 00:18:47,900
Are you sure you can't build it again?

1176
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:51,370
I do not want to repeat the same mistake.

1177
00:18:51,370 --> 00:18:54,930
Besides, I believe that Queen Elisabeth 
wants her final rest.

1178
00:18:54,930 --> 00:18:57,820
You won't know that unless you talk to her!

1179
00:18:57,820 --> 00:19:00,730
I don't think what you tried 
to build was wrong!

1180
00:19:00,730 --> 00:19:02,080
I refuse to accept it!

1181
00:19:02,490 --> 00:19:04,980
It's too sad to let it end this way.

1182
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:12,250
So, what do you say we kick this Crimson guy's butt 
and get your queen back?

1183
00:19:13,080 --> 00:19:14,210
Claire...

1184
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:18,920
Thank you.

1185
00:19:24,660 --> 00:19:27,070
I promise we will rescue 
your brother, as well.

1186
00:19:27,320 --> 00:19:31,160
I'll do that myself, with panache, 
so mind your own business, okay?

1187
00:19:38,990 --> 00:19:39,860
Yes!

1188
00:19:40,470 --> 00:19:42,720
My heart is full!

1189
00:19:43,430 --> 00:19:48,470
Just what I'd expect from a vampires' treasury, 
they've got quite the collection here.

1190
00:19:48,470 --> 00:19:52,010
Oh, yeah. I think I ran into my sister 
back there somewhere...

1191
00:19:53,320 --> 00:19:56,390
Whatever. She can take care of herself.

1192
00:19:56,850 --> 00:19:59,050
Pan Kogh's famous painting, "Slumber Hours".

1193
00:19:59,050 --> 00:20:01,320
I got plenty of art, so I'll pass on that.

1194
00:20:01,820 --> 00:20:05,430
Jewels can be pretty unwieldy 
when they've already been inlaid into stuff.

1195
00:20:05,430 --> 00:20:06,780
That's another pass.

1196
00:20:08,220 --> 00:20:10,610
And that means my targets are limited.

1197
00:20:10,970 --> 00:20:13,470
One coin the size of a 500-yen piece, 
worth a 100,000 zeni.

1198
00:20:13,470 --> 00:20:16,720
Plus, it has the efficiency and reliability factor 
of being ready to use as-is.

1199
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:19,320
And most of all, it's extremely portable.

1200
00:20:19,600 --> 00:20:22,280
Well, this is the world we live in.

1201
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:25,360
Just like Epsilon pads her chest with slime,

1202
00:20:25,360 --> 00:20:28,220
I will pad my slime with coins.

1203
00:20:29,210 --> 00:20:31,610
A thousand coins, a hundred million zeni.

1204
00:20:31,610 --> 00:20:36,460
I plan to live at least three hundred years, 
so that's not gonna be nearly enough.

1205
00:20:36,460 --> 00:20:38,810
But I have a boss battle coming up.

1206
00:20:39,120 --> 00:20:42,500
I've been showing up fashionably late 
a lot recently, and it's starting to get old.

1207
00:20:42,500 --> 00:20:44,210
I gotta change it up sometimes.

1208
00:20:44,210 --> 00:20:48,090
Operation: "Start the Last Boss Battle 
Before the Named Characters Show Up, So They'll See It and Be All,

1209
00:20:48,090 --> 00:20:50,550
'Whoa, what an intense battle! 
There's no way we can fight like that!'"

1210
00:20:50,550 --> 00:20:51,230
is a go!

1211
00:20:51,730 --> 00:20:52,930
It's perfect.

1212
00:20:53,430 --> 00:20:57,210
They've already announced that this time 
the boss is a super-powerful vampire.

1213
00:20:57,210 --> 00:21:01,020
A rare opportunity. 
Maybe I'll make an extra flashy entrance.

1214
00:21:06,370 --> 00:21:10,420
Your flesh and bones have wasted away, 
reducing you to nothing but your heart.

1215
00:21:10,780 --> 00:21:13,770
And yet you are beautiful still, My Queen.

1216
00:21:14,090 --> 00:21:17,480
Let us paint the world in blood once more.

1217
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:19,040
On this night so befitting us,

1218
00:21:19,040 --> 00:21:22,500
a scarlet night of blood and terror...

1219
00:21:24,980 --> 00:21:26,980
Now, return to life!

1220
00:21:27,680 --> 00:21:29,570
My dearly beloved!

1221
00:21:29,570 --> 00:21:31,570
And let us bind ourselves 
together in matrimoâ

1222
00:21:43,990 --> 00:21:46,280
The hour of awakening is near.

1223
00:21:47,190 --> 00:21:48,980
The frenzy has begun.

